OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is next for the Grafton
OL,4,ACentre?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of a project to
OL,7,Ftransform a city shopping centre is
OL,8,Fexpected to be finished in 2029.
OL,10,FPioneer Group got planning permission
OL,11,Fto redevelop The Grafton Centre, in
OL,12,FCambridge, in 2024. The first phase of
OL,13,Fthe project was initially due to be
OL,14,Ffinished in 2028.
OL,16,FSubjit Jassy, the group's development
OL,17,Fand asset management director, said
OL,18,Fhalf a million square feet (46,450 sq
OL,19,Fm) would be revamped.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
