OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is next for the Grafton
OL,4,ACentre?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In this first phase we're delivering
OL,7,Fhalf of that... and of that about
OL,8,F38,000 to 40,000 square feet (3,530 to
OL,9,F3,716 sq m) will be an incubator for
OL,10,Flife science and tech start-ups in
OL,11,FCambridge," he added.
